**CAVEMAN ORGANIC**

*"**Bridging Superfoods **&** Your Lifestyle**"*

BRAND BIBLE v2.0 | Brahhm Arpan Organic Pvt. Ltd.

# 1. BRAND FOUNDATION

**Brand Name ****&**** Meaning**

Caveman evokes going back to basics — eating the way our ancestors did, before processed food existed. The name signals primal nutrition, ancient wisdom, and a rejection of artificial ingredients. The cave painting motifs in the logo reinforce this back-to-roots identity.

**Mission Statement**

To provide organic millet cookies, roasted nuts and seeds that make switching from unhealthy snacking habits easy, enjoyable, and accessible for all age groups.

**Core Values**

• Bold Nutrition — Ancient grains that do not compromise on taste

• Ingredient Honesty — Every ingredient named, nothing hidden

• Accessibility — Snacks for kids, adults, and seniors alike

• Authenticity — Certified organic, no artificial preservatives

• Rootedness — Inspired by ancient Indian grains and food wisdom

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 2. TARGET AUDIENCE

**Primary Personas**

• Health-Conscious Snacker — 25–45 yrs, urban, replacing chips/biscuits

• Active & Fitness-Oriented — Gym-goers, post-workout snackers, protein-aware

• Conscious Parent — Wants nutritious snacks kids will actually eat

• Gluten-Intolerant / Celiac — Seeks certified gluten-free options

• Tea-Time Traditionalist — Replacing regular biscuits with a better alternative

**What They Care About**

• Taste first — health is the bonus, not the sacrifice

• Clean ingredient labels — no numbers, no chemicals

• Portability — office, gym, travel snacks

• Value for money — ₹80–₹124 is a reachable premium

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 3. BRAND VOICE & TONE

**Tone Descriptors**

• Bold — Confident claims, strong headlines, no timid language

• Playful — Fun product names, light humour where earned

• Energetic — Short punchy sentences, action verbs, excitement

• Authentic — Real ingredients, real benefits, no marketing fluff

**Words We Use**

Fuel / instinct / junk-free / zero-compromise / primal / ancient grain / millet-powered / no maida / no palm oil / real butter / certified organic / clean label / guilt-free [Caveman only]

**Words We Avoid**

Clinical/medical language — we are not a pharmaceutical brand. Preachy eco-statements. Complicated jargon without explanation. Soft wellness-brand energy.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# 4. VISUAL IDENTITY

**Brand Colours — Canonical Hex Codes**

• Cave Red: #BE1A1A — Primary brand colour (use in all brand contexts)

• Deep Crimson: #8B0000 — Accent, shadows, depth

• Black: #000000 — Background, always surrounds the logo

• White: #FFFFFF — Logo text, typography on dark backgrounds

• Cave Brown: #1A0A00 — Cave art motifs, decorative elements

| **⚠ FIREFLY COLOUR NOTE** Adobe Firefly prompts use #D20000 as the prompt-safe approximation of Cave Red. This is intentional — it generates closer to the brand colour than #BE1A1A in Firefly's colour engine. Always use #BE1A1A in all non-Firefly brand contexts (Canva, design files, presentations). |
| --- |

**Photography Style (Real Photography)**

• Dark, moody backgrounds — black, charcoal, deep brown

• Rustic textures: stone, cave-like surfaces

• Product shots: cookies/seeds spilling naturally, overhead or 45°

• Ingredient hero shots: millets, nuts, seeds in raw form

• Lifestyle: active people, post-gym, outdoor settings

**Firefly AI Visual Direction**

| **⚠ AI GENERATION RULE — NO RUSTIC PROPS** This section OVERRIDES the photography section above for all AI-generated images. Firefly prompts must never include: wooden bowls / burlap / jute / mortar & pestle / clay pots / antique props / weathered wood as primary surface. USE INSTEAD: matte ceramic / dark marble surface / acrylic stands / sleek modern kitchen elements / dark slate. |
| --- |

• Hero space must always be left clean and empty for Photoshop compositing

• No product packaging generated by AI — ever

• Dominant palette: deep reds, blacks, charcoal. No pastels.

• Best templates: T1, T6, T9, T10, T13, T17 — see Visual Execution Engine

