# 5. CONTENT PRIORITY GUIDE

For full SKU list, prices, and availability — consult Live_Inventory_Catalog.xlsx. This section covers content angles and posting priorities only.

**Priority Tier 1 — Post Most Often**

**Signature Millet Cookies (₹124 per pack)**

Hero products. Highest differentiation. Each variant has a unique millet story.

• Fit-o-Milleto → fitness, post-gym, protein angle

• Flax Amaranth Connection → omega-3, women's health angle

• Kodo Coco Fun → fun flavour, kid-friendly angle

• Millet Era → ancient grain education, foxtail millet story

• Super Kodo Honey Magic → honey + millet, indulgence angle

**Roasted Seeds ****&**** Nuts (₹272–₹469 per pack)**

High value, high margin. Gym audience, mindful snacking. Nutritional stats drive saves.

• Cashews ₹469 — premium nut, protein story

• Watermelon Seeds ₹390 — antioxidant, summer angle

• Pumpkin Seeds ₹356 — magnesium, immunity story

• Sunflower Seeds ₹272 — entry point, everyday snack

**Priority Tier 2 — Post Regularly**

**Bakkit Range (₹80–₹124 per pack)**

Volume products. Entry-point buyers. Family and tea-time angle. Wider audience reach.

• Ajwain, Jeera, Coconut, Cashew & Pista → ₹80 — everyday, accessible

• Fruit & Nut, Singhada, Jowar Pista → ₹124 — premium Bakkit

**SKU Flags**

| **⚠ DISCONTINUED — DO NOT POST** Caveman Superseeds Protein Bar — Out of stock, discontinued. Do not reference in any post, caption, or campaign. If asked about it, redirect to the Roasted Seeds & Nuts range. |
| --- |

**Content Angle by Product Type**

• Cookies → Snack Swap comparison / Millet education / Ingredient transparency

• Seeds → Nutritional stats / Comparison with junk snacks / Gym/fitness context

• Combo posts → Dark Surface Premium (T9) template / Multi-product showcase

• Brand story → Label Padhega angle / Cave art identity / Ancient grain heritage

