# 6. CONTENT PILLARS

• Snack Swap — Replace X with Caveman. Before/after comparisons.

• Ingredient Spotlight — Hero ingredients: millets, flaxseed, pumpkin seeds.

• Recipe & Usage — How to eat cookies creatively, seeds in salads/smoothies.

• Label Transparency — Show every ingredient. Invite comparison. We win.

• Millet Education — What is kodo/foxtail/amaranth millet and why it matters.

• Social Proof — Customer reviews, unboxing, UGC reposts.

• Festive & Seasonal — Gift packs, seasonal launches, occasion content.

