# 7. COMPETITIVE POSITIONING

**What Makes Caveman Different**

• Only organic millet cookie brand with cave art as visual identity

• 12 varieties — widest millet cookie range in category

• Accessible price point — ₹80–₹124 is reachable premium

• Celiac-friendly gluten-free range (6 varieties) alongside mainstream options

• Clean label: No maida, no palm oil, real butter — provable claims

**The Label Padhega India Angle**

"We'll show you everything on our label. Because we have nothing to hide."

Specific post angle: Show the Caveman ingredient list. Short, readable, real. Then show a competitor category label (unnamed). The contrast does the work.

**Price Positioning**

₹80 (Bakkit) and ₹124 (Signature) positions Caveman as a premium-but-reachable alternative to regular biscuits (₹20–₹40). Goal is everyday adoption, not occasional indulgence.

